<p>We expose a <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">wireToViewController:</code> method for external code that needs to create the transition.</p>

<p>In the code above, we found this:</p>

<div class="language-objc highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><table class="rouge-table"><tbody><tr><td class="rouge-gutter gl"><pre class="lineno">1
